      <title>No Interest on Belated Excise Duty where Situation is Revenue-Neutral: Calcutta HC Upholds CESTAT Order in SAIL Case [Read Order]</title>
      <link>https://www.taxscan.in/top-stories/no-interest-on-belated-excise-duty-where-situation-is-revenue-neutral-calcutta-hc-upholds-cestat-order-in-sail-case-1440657</link>
      <description>The Court held that interest, being compensatory in nature, presupposes a loss to the revenue. Where there is no pecuniary prejudice to the exchequer, insistence on interest would be not required.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.taxscan.in/top-stories/no-interest-on-belated-excise-duty-where-situation-is-revenue-neutral-calcutta-hc-upholds-cestat-order-in-sail-case-1440657</guid>
